      "description": "Entire linked row on the stone homepage service surface.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-service-surface\"><a class=\"ds-service\" href=\"#service\"><h3>企業 AI 應用</h3><p>探索企業 AI 導入與系統應用。</p><span>查看服務與案例 </span></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-service-surface{background:#f4f3f0;padding:0 20px}.ds-service{font-family:\"Noto Sans TC\",sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr 170px;gap:20px;align-items:center;padding:25px 0;border-top:1px solid #d3ceca;border-bottom:1px solid #d3ceca;color:#262323;text-decoration:none;transition:padding .25s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1),background-color .25s}.ds-service h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}.ds-service p{font-size:13px;color:#57514e;margin:0}.ds-service span{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#a71320}.ds-service:hover{padding-left:10px;padding-right:10px;background:#ebe6e2}.ds-service:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #007647;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:740px){.ds-service{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;padding:22px 0}.ds-service h3{font-size:25px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-service{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "service-row"
    },
    {
      "name": "Article outline",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Conditional semantic table of contents derived from existing h2 headings.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-outline-nav\"><details open><summary>文章目錄</summary><nav aria-label=\"文章目錄\"><a href=\"#section-1\">從應用場景開始</a><a href=\"#section-2\">評估資料與環境</a></nav></details></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-outline-nav{font-family:\"Noto Sans TC\",sans-serif;max-width:190px;border-top:2px solid #a71320;padding-top:14px;color:#262323}.ds-outline-nav summary{min-height:36px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.ds-outline-nav nav{display:grid;margin-top:12px}.ds-outline-nav a{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;min-height:44px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d3ceca;color:#655b55;text-decoration:none}.ds-outline-nav a:hover{color:#92101c}.ds-outline-nav :is(summary,a):focus-visible{outline:3px solid #007647;outline-offset:4px}"
